{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn your love for tabletop games into a thriving business, where every shelf, dice, and customer tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock your shelves, host board game sessions, craft your own games, and build a shop loved by collectors and gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Customize_Your_Shop.png?t=1745600859\" />Build, move, and arrange your shelves the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design a layout that fits your style and keeps your store efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Building.gif?t=1745600859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Shelf_Stocking.png?t=1745600859\" />Unpack deliveries and place your products with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Organize your inventory smartly to keep customers happy and your store efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Filling.gif?t=1745600859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Level_Up.png?t=1745600859\" />Level up to unlock new licenses, products, and expand your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level brings fresh opportunities and deeper gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/LevelUp.gif?t=1745600859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Floor_Cleaning.png?t=1745600859\" />Don\u2019t let the mess drive customers away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your mop to keep the store spotless and earn cleaner feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Mopping.gif?t=1745600859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Odor_Control.png?t=1745600859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smelly store? Customers won\u2019t stay long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use sprays and fans to remove odor and maintain a fresh shopping environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Sprey.gif?t=1745600859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Table_Maintenance.png?t=1745600859\" />Keep the game tables clean between sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tidy environment makes your store the perfect hangout spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/TableClean.gif?t=1745600859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Board_Game_Experiences.png?t=1745600859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up game tables, craft your own board games from collected components, and host play sessions to earn extra income and attract dedicated players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Collection_System.png?t=1745600859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell themed figures to complete collections and unlock unique dioramas and rewards. Completed collections increase your shop's appeal and value.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3328620?t=1745600859","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745600859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/81b6b4638f521543e666b6c6e4338dd7be844a1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745600859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/81b6b4638f521543e666b6c6e4338dd7be844a1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745600859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn your love for tabletop games into a thriving business, where every shelf, dice, and customer tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock your shelves, host board game sessions, craft your own games, and build a shop loved by collectors and gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Customize_Your_Shop.png?t=1745600859\" />Build, move, and arrange your shelves the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design a layout that fits your style and keeps your store efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328620/extras/Building.gif?t=1745600859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sh